{title: Glory Of The Lord Is Coming Down}
{key: F}
{x_theme: prayer}
{x_source: chrd:glory_of_the_lord_is_coming_down.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
Coming [F]down, down, down
Coming [Bb]down, down, [F]down
The [Dm]glory of the [F]Lord is coming [C]down
When the [F]saints begin to pray
For the [Bb]Lord to have his [F]way
Then the [F]glory of the [C]Lord is coming [F]down
